1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:39,360
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 13=

3
00:00:39,719 --> 00:00:40,439
Sir.

4
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,259
I'm a lawyer.

5
00:00:42,679 --> 00:00:43,399
For this case,

6
00:00:43,939 --> 00:00:45,420
I can help you with legal aid.

7
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,140
A lawyer?

8
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:50,240
I'm sorry.

9
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,679
I can't afford a lawyer.

10
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:52,759
Don't worry.

11
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:54,799
Legal aid is free.

12
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:56,619
Miss,

13
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,240
is that really true?

14
00:00:58,640 --> 00:00:59,439
Yes, it is.

15
00:00:59,679 --> 00:01:01,020
I need the contractor's name

16
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,159
and the site's address.

17
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:03,060
Then I'll take it from there.

18
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:12,819
Thank you.

19
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,319
Thank you so much.

20
00:01:14,659 --> 00:01:15,819
You're welcome. Glad to help.

21
00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:17,239
Thank you.

22
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:24,800
(Jiangcheng Affiliated Hospital)

23
00:01:35,459 --> 00:01:36,739
You're pretty.

24
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:39,780
Are you Dr. Pei's girlfriend?

25
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:42,359
I saw you holding hands.

26
00:01:43,099 --> 00:01:43,560
Xiaoyu.

27
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,040
Hush now.

28
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:04,560
(Jiangcheng Affiliated Hospital)

29
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:09,759
Taking on Xiaoyu's case...

30
00:02:10,139 --> 00:02:11,840
Will it affect your other cases?

31
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:14,840
Legal aid takes a lot of work.

32
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:15,740
What?

33
00:02:16,379 --> 00:02:17,659
Only you get to help people?

34
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,280
I can't?

35
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,060
You've always been kind.

36
00:02:40,039 --> 00:02:41,759
Guess what we're having

37
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:42,539
for dinner.

38
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,240
Hot pot!

39
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,240
You got it.

40
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:48,719
Let's go.

41
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:52,479
Let's go to that really good place.

42
00:02:53,060 --> 00:02:54,560
And we must get your favorite tripe.

43
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:55,159
Right?

44
00:03:02,719 --> 00:03:03,439
All rise.

45
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:05,660
(Plaintiff / Counsel)

46
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:06,939
(Counsel / Defendant)

47
00:03:06,939 --> 00:03:07,860
Court is adjourned.

48
00:03:07,860 --> 00:03:11,460
(Plaintiff / Counsel)

49
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:14,139
Let's go.

50
00:03:17,199 --> 00:03:17,800
Mom.

51
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:23,380
(Counsel / Defendant)

52
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:35,720
(Defendant)

53
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,699
20 years of love and companionship,

54
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,060
and in the end,

55
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,259
we're fighting over numbers

56
00:03:43,259 --> 00:03:44,280
on a piece of paper.

57
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:50,719
Thank you,

58
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:51,479
Ms. Wen.

59
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,599
It's my job.

60
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,800
It's what you pay me for.

61
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:00,900
Congratulations.

62
00:04:05,879 --> 00:04:06,919
You won after all.

63
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,360
You did well too.

64
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,560
You nearly turned it around for him.

65
00:04:14,199 --> 00:04:15,159
As for Mr. Liu,

66
00:04:15,879 --> 00:04:17,120
I really didn't know.

67
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:19,860
I know.

68
00:04:20,639 --> 00:04:21,240
Not your style.

69
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:24,839
By the way,

70
00:04:25,740 --> 00:04:26,920
I've told Su Mu.

71
00:04:27,399 --> 00:04:28,680
It's time

72
00:04:28,879 --> 00:04:30,139
you two sorted things out.

73
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:47,420
(Diamond Plaza)

74
00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:03,379
What's wrong, bro?

75
00:05:04,379 --> 00:05:05,540
You seem off.

76
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:09,399
No luck at work.

77
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,560
Or in love, either.

78
00:05:14,639 --> 00:05:15,519
Drinks are on me tonight.

79
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,880
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
